{
  "id": 1965,
  "title": "Who Am I?",
  "russian_title": "Кто я?",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "who-am-i",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1965_who-am-i.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Ever since she was little, the younger sister had had a strange illness: she could remember no more than four people. As he watched her grow up, her older brother told her, “If you meet someone you love, forget me instead. Just take good care of Mom and Dad.”",
    "One day, her brother got a phone call. His sister was crying. “Brother, who am I?” she asked. He was so moved that he couldn’t speak. She would rather forget herself than forget the family she loved most."
  ],
  "english_full": "Ever since she was little, the younger sister had had a strange illness: she could remember no more than four people. As he watched her grow up, her older brother told her, “If you meet someone you love, forget me instead. Just take good care of Mom and Dad.”\n\nOne day, her brother got a phone call. His sister was crying. “Brother, who am I?” she asked. He was so moved that he couldn’t speak. She would rather forget herself than forget the family she loved most.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "С тех пор, как она была мла́дшей, сестрёнка имела стра́нную боле́знь: она не могла по́мнить бо́льше четве́рки люде́й. Пока он смотрел, как она выраста́ет, ста́рший брат говорил ей: “Если ты встре́тишь кого́-то, кого любишь, забу́дь обо мне вме́сто. Просто забо́тся о ма́ме и па́пе.”",
    "Одна́жды его брат позвони́л. Сестра́ пла́чем спро́сила: “Брат, кто я?” Он был так тронут, что не мог говори́ть. Она лу́чше забу́дет себя́, чем семью, которую люби́ла наи́больше."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "S tékh por, kak ona byla mládshей, sestríonka iméla stránnuyu boléznʹ: ona ne moǵla pómnitʹ bólʹshe chetvérki lyudéy. Poka on smotrél, kak ona vyrastáet, stárshiy brat govoríl eй: “Esli ty vstrétish kogó-to, kogó lýbishʹ, zabudʹ obo mne vmesto. Prósto zabotáysʹ o máme i pápe.”",
    "Odńazhdy ego brat pozvónil. Sestrá pláchem sprósila: “Brat, kto ya?” On byl tak tronут, chto ne moǵ govorítʹ. Ona lúchshe zabudʹet sebé, chem semʹyu, kotorúy lubíla náĭbolshe."
  ],
